---
import boundaries from '../data/provinces.json';
import data from '../data/burned-area.json';
import Cite from './Cite.astro';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
const project=([lng,lat]:number[])=>[(lng-108)*63+25,(5.1-lat)*63+15];
const polygonPath=(coords:number[][][])=>coords.map(ring=>ring.map((p,i)=>`${i?'L':'M'}${project(p).map(v=>v.toFixed(1)).join(',')}`).join('')+'Z').join('');
const geometryPath=(g:any)=>g.type==='MultiPolygon'?g.coordinates.map(polygonPath).join(''):polygonPath(g.coordinates);
const fmt=(n:number)=>new Intl.NumberFormat('id-ID',{maximumFractionDigits:0}).format(n);
const color=(v:number)=>v<10000?'#52665c':v<50000?'#b8b58b':v<100000?'#d5a367':v<200000?'#d37445':'#b54e33';
const initialIndex=4;
const labels=[{id:'barat',x:204,y:337,name:'Kalimantan Barat'},{id:'tengah',x:375,y:441,name:'Kalimantan Tengah'},{id:'selatan',x:486,y:523,name:'Kalimantan Selatan'},{id:'timur',x:535,y:319,name:'Kalimantan Timur'},{id:'utara',x:578,y:119,name:'Kalimantan Utara'}];
---
<div class="map-toolbar"><div class="year-options" role="group" aria-label="Pilih tahun data">{data.years.map(y=><button class:list={['year-button',{'active':y===2023}]} data-year={y} aria-pressed={y===2023}>{y}</button>)}</div><a class="text-link" href="/data/karhutla-kalimantan-2019-2023.csv" download>Unduh data CSV <Icon name="download" size={16}/></a></div>
<div class="map-layout" id="data-map">
<div class="map-visual">
<svg id="province-map" viewBox="0 0 760 650" aria-labelledby="map-title map-desc">
<title id="map-title">Luas karhutla lima provinsi Kalimantan tahun 2023</title><desc id="map-desc">Pilih provinsi pada peta atau gunakan pilihan provinsi di sebelahnya. Warna menunjukkan luas absolut dalam hektare, bukan persentase wilayah. Data juga tersedia dalam tabel.</desc>
<g class="map-grid" aria-hidden="true">{[0,1,2,3,4,5].map(i=><path d={`M${i*120+70},20 V600 M40,${i*105+45} H710`}/>)}<text x="55" y="625">110° BT</text><text x="646" y="625">118° BT</text></g>
<g aria-hidden="true" class="map-context"><text x="160" y="130">Malaysia & Brunei</text><text x="160" y="151" class="map-context-sub">Di luar cakupan data</text><text x="92" y="506" class="map-water">Laut Jawa</text><text x="641" y="403" class="map-water" transform="rotate(-90 641 403)">Selat Makassar</text><path d="M694 88v-37m-6 10 6-10 6 10" stroke="currentColor" fill="none"/><text x="688" y="40">U</text></g>
{boundaries.features.map(f=>{const p=data.provinces.find(p=>p.shapeName===f.properties.shapeName)!;return <path d={geometryPath(f.geometry)} data-province={p.id} data-name={p.name} fill={color(p.values[initialIndex])} class:list={['province',{'selected':p.id==='tengah'}]} tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label={`${p.name}: ${fmt(p.values[initialIndex])} hektare, 2023`} aria-pressed={p.id==='tengah'}><title>{p.name}: {fmt(p.values[initialIndex])} ha</title></path>})}
<path id="province-outline" class="province-outline" d={geometryPath(boundaries.features.find(f=>f.properties.shapeName==='Central Kalimantan')!.geometry)} aria-hidden="true"/>
<g class="map-labels" aria-hidden="true">{labels.map(l=><text data-label-province={l.id} fill={data.provinces.find(p=>p.id===l.id)!.values[4]<10000 ? '#fff' : '#12251c'} x={l.x} y={l.y} text-anchor="middle">{l.name.replace('Kalimantan ','')}<tspan x={l.x} dy="17" data-map-label={l.id}>{fmt(data.provinces.find(p=>p.id===l.id)!.values[4])} ha</tspan></text>)}</g>
</svg>
<div class="map-legend"><span>Luas karhutla (ha)</span><div class="legend-colors">{[['#52665c','<10 rb'],['#b8b58b','10–50 rb'],['#d5a367','50–100 rb'],['#d37445','100–200 rb'],['#b54e33','≥200 rb']].map(([c,l])=><span><i style={`--swatch:${c}`}></i>{l}</span>)}</div></div>
</div>
<div class="map-detail"><label class="small" for="province-select">Pilih provinsi</label><select id="province-select">{data.provinces.map(p=><option value={p.id} selected={p.id==='tengah'}>{p.name}</option>)}</select><div class="province-stat" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><p id="selected-province-name">Kalimantan Tengah</p><p class="big-data"><span id="selected-area">165.896</span><span class="unit"> ha</span></p><p class="small muted-light">Luas karhutla tercatat · <span id="selected-year">2023</span></p></div><div class="mini-chart" aria-label="Perbandingan luas karhutla Kalimantan Tengah 2019 sampai 2023">{data.years.map((y,i)=><div class="mini-bar-wrap"><span class="mini-bar" data-bar-year={y} style={`--bar-height:${Math.max(3,data.provinces[1].values[i]/317749*100)}%`}><span class="sr-only">{fmt(data.provinces[1].values[i])} hektare</span></span><span>{y}</span></div>)}</div><p class="map-total">Total lima provinsi pada <span data-total-year>2023</span><strong><span id="total-area">508.430</span> ha</strong></p><p class="small muted-light">Penjumlahan oleh proyek; tampilan dibulatkan. Nilai asli tersedia di tabel dan CSV.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="map-notes"><p>Warna menunjukkan luas absolut, bukan proporsi provinsi. Seluruh jenis lahan; bukan hanya gambut. <Cite id="klhk"/></p><p>Batas disederhanakan: geoBoundaries / © kontributor OpenStreetMap. <Cite id="geo"/></p></div>
<details class="data-table-details"><summary>Lihat tabel angka asli <Icon name="plus" size={18}/></summary><div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Tabel luas karhutla 2019 sampai 2023"><table><caption>Luas karhutla per provinsi (ha). Sumber: Statistik KLHK 2023, Tabel 7.2.</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Provinsi</th>{data.years.map(y=><th scope="col">{y}</th>)}</tr></thead><tbody>{data.provinces.map(p=><tr><th scope="row">{p.name}</th>{p.values.map(v=><td>{v.toLocaleString('id-ID',{minimumFractionDigits:2,maximumFractionDigits:2})}</td>)}</tr>)}</tbody></table></div></details>
<noscript><p class="notice">Aktifkan JavaScript untuk mengubah peta. Seluruh data tetap tersedia dalam tabel di atas dan unduhan CSV.</p></noscript>
<script>
import '../scripts/map';
</script>
